@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "FAQ";
    ViewData["ActivePage"] = "Faq";
}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <p>Answers to the questions we expect admins, faculty, and students to ask most.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary>Who can log in to the Faculty Information System?</summary>
        <p>Administrators and faculty members each have their own accounts with role-based permissions, so what you can see and do depends on your role.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How do I update my faculty profile?</summary>
        <p>Once logged in, faculty can update personal information, qualifications, and department details from the Faculty Profile Management section.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How does course enrollment work?</summary>
        <p>Enrollment is linked directly to departments and semesters. Students register for courses, and add/drop changes are handled within the enrollment window for that term.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How do I request leave?</summary>
        <p>Leave requests are submitted through Leave Management and routed to the relevant approver. You can track the status of a request until it's approved or declined.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Where can faculty log research and publications?</summary>
        <p>Research & Project Management lets faculty add research projects, publications, supervisors, and student participants as work progresses.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How do I get faculty workload or academic reports?</summary>
        <p>Administrators can generate student reports, faculty workload summaries, and academic statistics from Report Management.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Who do I contact if I have a problem I can't find an answer to here?</summary>
        <p>Reach out through the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> and we'll get back to you.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
